  {
   "type": "cols",
   "layout": "50-50",
   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h2> Enter, compare, done—ZOLLER »lasso« </h2>",
      "body": "<p>With the lasso function, users can enter tool data more intuitively and efficiently than ever before. After measurement, the complete actual contour appears on the lasso screen, where it can be precisely positioned—ensuring exact determination of the tool center and perfect alignment with the material.</p> <p>Simply by outlining the relevant area, all important information is automatically detected, intelligently grouped, and directly incorporated into the process. This not only reduces the number of clicks and potential operating errors but also noticeably speeds up tool data capture—resulting in a significantly smoother, faster, and reliably stable workflow during set up and maintenance. </p> <h4>Advantages of the »lasso« function</h4><ul><li>Thousands of measuring points in seconds—freely selectable from 0 to 360°</li><li>Precise nominal/actual comparison with tolerance range and variable allowance</li><li>Specialized functions for stone-cutting tools</li></ul>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
